  "post_content": "<p align=\"JUSTIFY\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0cm; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13px; text-align: justify; widows: 2; orphans: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">La empresa BECSA est&aacute; realizando este mi&eacute;rcoles trabajos de reasfaltado de la avenida de l&#39;Alcora, por encargo del Ayuntamiento de Onda por lo que el tr&aacute;fico se desviaba por la ma&ntilde;ana por las calles Mallorca y N&aacute;poles, hasta la avenida de Catalunya.</span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5296.jpg\" alt=\"img_5296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5297.jpg\" alt=\"img_5297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5298.jpg\" alt=\"img_5298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5299.jpg\" alt=\"img_5299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5300.jpg\" alt=\"img_5300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5301.jpg\" alt=\"img_5301\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5302.jpg\" alt=\"img_5302\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrerlalcoraonda/img_5303.jpg\" alt=\"img_5303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asfaltatcarrer